## Privacy boundary

- no Yandex script/network before explicit opt-in;
- no Webvisor/session replay;
- no click map, outbound-link tracking, accurate bounce events, hash tracking or page-title transmission;
- no custom events, user parameters, ecommerce or noscript tracking;
